[en.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_SHOW]
Glorious Comeback

[en.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_SHOW_desc]
The long lost magician of the magic world, Duchess of Ponyville, the Great and Powerful — Trixie Lulamoon, is back today!\nTonight at 20:00, in front of the Ponyville City Hall, don’t miss it!

[zh.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_SHOW]
辉煌复出

[zh.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_SHOW_desc]
魔术界退隐已久的注明魔术师，小马谷公爵，伟大又全能的——特丽克西·卢拉月，今日复出！\n今晚20:00，小马谷市政厅门前，不见不散！

